WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.574
We're at the Space Center.

2
00:00:01.574 --> 00:00:06.295
Like a space launch, your business needs the right protections before it leaves the pad.

3
00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:11.016
The most expensive mistakes here are the ones founders don't see until it's too late.

4
00:00:11.016 --> 00:00:19.199
In this module, you'll make three key protection decisions: Why your home-country IP protection does not cover you in the U.S., and what to file first.

5
00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:22.976
Which insurance policies you need from day one, and which can wait.

6
00:00:22.976 --> 00:00:28.326
When to handle legal work yourself, and when bringing in an attorney can actually save you money.

7
00:00:28.326 --> 00:00:34.621
If you take one thing from this module: file for U.S. trademark protection early, ideally before you invest in marketing.

8
00:00:34.621 --> 00:00:35.880
Let's get into it.
